Package: eazy-gnome
Version: 3.3.2
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: eazy contributors <vapesmadcat-blip@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: eazy (>= 3.3)
Recommends: gnome-terminal, nautilus, gedit, evince, xdg-utils
Description: eazy desktop integration for Gnome
 Meta-package for eazy with recommended Gnome terminal, file manager and
 desktop utilities. The eazy executable is provided by the base eazy package.
